{"id":"vermutet","lemma":"vermutet","pos":"adj","rank":3723,"glosses":["supposed, suspected","assumed, presumed"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/De-vermutet.ogg/De-vermutet.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Niemand hatte etwas vermutet.","en":"Nobody suspected anything.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"something"},null]},{"text":"Das hatte ich bereits vermutet.","en":"I had suspected as much.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"already"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben es vermutet.","en":"We assumed so.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"it"},null]},{"text":"Alles geschah genau, wie ich es vermutet hatte.","en":"Everything happened exactly as I had thought.","words":[{"g":"everything"},{"g":"to occur","l":"geschehen"},{"g":"just, exactly"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Du hast vermutet, ich würde heute Nacht nicht kommen, oder?","en":"You thought I wouldn't come tonight, didn't you?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"dignity"},null,null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to come"},{"g":"or"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"tonight"]]}]}